===Verb===
{{is-verb-strong|stóð|stóðu|staðið}}

# {{lb|is|intransitive}} to [[stand]] (up), to be standing
# {{lb|is|intransitive}} to [[stand]], to be [[situated]]
# {{lb|is|intransitive}} to [[stand]], to be [[valid]]
