==Old Norse==

===Etymology===
{{root|non|ine-pro|*steh₂-}}
From {{inh|non|gem-pro|*standaną}}. The verb occurred in two forms within Germanic, but only this form is attested in Old Norse sources. In the east, this form existed side by side with unattested {{m|non||*stá}} (from which {{cog|sv|stå}}), from {{cog|gem-pro|*stāną}}. Both ultimately derive from the same {{der|non|ine-pro|*steh₂-}}.

